[Music]  when you realize nothing is lacking the  whole world belongs to you  [Music]  rest and be kind you don't have to prove  anything  [Music]  nothing ever goes away until it has  taught us what we need to know  [Music]  the mind of the beginner is empty free  of the habits of the expert ready to  accept to doubt and open to all the  possibilities  [Music]  wherever you are it's the place you need  to be  [Music]  treat every moment as or last it is not  preparation for something else  [Music]  learn to be comfortable in adversity but  most importantly learn to be comfortable  when you're bored  [Music]  there are only two ways to live your  life  one is as if nothing is a miracle the  other is as if everything is a miracle  [Music]  if you know the enemy and know yourself  you need not fear the result of a  hundred battles  [Music]  respect life revere life  there is nothing more holy than life  nothing more divine than life  our sorrows and wounds are healed only  when we touch them with compassion  [Music]  the good life can be as simple as just  paying attention  [Music]  nature is full of chaos and conflict  don't resist these things  invite them in  [Music]  love is a gift of one's innermost soul  to another so both can be whole  [Music]  the words of the buddha offer this truth  hatred never ceases by hatred but by  love alone is healed  [Music]  just as a mother would protect her only  child with her life even so let one  cultivate a boundless love towards all  beings  [Music]  remember that the best relationship is  one in which your love for each other  exceeds your need for each other  [Music]  friendship is the purest love it is the  highest form of love where nothing is  asked for no condition where one simply  enjoys giving  [Music]  hatred does not cease by hatred but only  by love  [Music]  love is of all passions the strongest  for it attacks simultaneously the head  the heart and the senses  [Music]  if a warrior is not unattached to life  and death he will be of no use  whatsoever  [Music]  peace of mind is that mental condition  in which you have accepted the worst  [Music]  the true miracle is not walking on water  or walking in air but simply walking on  this earth  [Music]  roads were made for journeys not  destinations  [Music]  the personal life deeply lived always  expands into truths beyond itself  when you accept what is every moment is  the best moment  that is enlightenment  not everything happens for a reason  nature is not rational just make peace  with whatever happens  [Music]  the way to free yourself of pain and  suffering is to accept it  [Music]  neither fire nor wind birth nor death  can erase our good deeds  [Music]  the world is afflicted by death and  decay but the wise do not grieve having  realized the nature of the world  [Music]  we all die  the goal isn't to live forever the goal  is to create something that will  [Music]  a man with outward courage dares to die  a man with inner courage dares to live  [Music]  i don't want to die without any scars  [Music]  the search for happiness is one of the  chief sources of unhappiness  [Music]  do not dwell in the past do not dream of  the future concentrate the mind on the  present moment  [Music]  do not let the behavior of others  destroy your inner peace  [Music]  if you want happiness for a year inherit  a fortune if you want happiness for a  lifetime help someone else  [Music]  there is no need for temples no need for  complicated philosophy our own brain our  own heart is our temple the philosophy  is kindness  thousands of candles can be lit from a  single candle and the life of the candle  will not be shortened  happiness never decreases by being  shared  [Music]  be kind whenever possible it is always  possible  [Music]  we do not exist for the suck of  something else we exist for the sack of  ourselves  [Music]  to be beautiful means to be yourself  you don't need to be accepted by others  you need to accept yourself  [Music]  do not follow the idea of others but  learn to listen to the voice within  yourself  [Music]  [Laughter]  happiness lies even in little tiny  butterflies you just have to open up  your eyes and see where beauty flies to  beautify your world lengthwise  [Music]  you

